{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561800/extras/22.png?t=1744348651\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will take on the role of a brave hero, embarking on a journey to defeat the Demon Lord,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">fighting thrilling battles alongside three companions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But it's not just your party members who will spoil you\u2014villagers and even the queen herself have prepared plenty of delightful events for you to enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Among the many characters, you're sure to find your favorite one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore dungeons, accidentally trigger traps, or take a relaxing soak in a hot spring...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dreamy adventure awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No matter what you do, you'll be met with warmth and acceptance\u2014so immerse yourself in this hero-friendly fantasy world to your heart's content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561800/extras/33.png?t=1744348651\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">JRPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill tree system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Selectable difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Auto-battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 20 romanceable characters!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561800?t=1744348651","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561800?t=1744348651","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561800/bb5fcf12a277df25fec80b8f03dbc6ae8c19d313/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744348651","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/356180